OL,3,AOne stolen every four minutes - inside
OL,4,Athe police battle against vehicle
OL,5,Athieves
OL,6,
OL,7,FDespite a recent drop, vehicle thefts
OL,8,Fare up almost 50% in England and Wales
OL,9,Fcompared with a decade ago, according
OL,10,Fto Home Office data. Last year, just 3%
OL,11,Fof vehicle theft offences resulted in a
OL,12,Fcharge or summons.
